    va ichki shtampovkadan iborat yopiq quti, ichida press-toblangan qo\u2018yma;
    polni egilishda ko\u2018taradi va yon zarbaga qarshilik qiladi."
  system: Structure
  material: High-strength steel
  explodeDirection: {x: 1, y: 0, z: 0}
