  nameEnglish: Front Right Hose
  nameUzbek: "Old o\u2018ng shlang"
  descriptionEnglish: Braided flexible hose from the body bracket to the caliper's
    banjo union; it lets the wheel steer and move up and down.
  descriptionUzbek: "Kuzov kronshteynidan support banjo ulagichigacha boradigan to\u2018qima
    qobiqli egiluvchan shlang; g\u2018ildirakka burilish va yuqoriga-pastga harakatlanishga
    imkon beradi."
  system: Brakes
  material: PTFE hose, stainless braid
  explodeDirection: {x: 0.8662031, y: 0, z: -0.49969208}
  explodeDistance: 0.6
  fineDetail: 0
