    tormozi kolodkalarini ushlovchi, har bir richag uchun ko\u2018z yoki vilkasi
    bo\u2018lgan quyma tirgak."
  system: Suspension
  material: Cast iron
  explodeDirection: {x: 1, y: 0, z: 0}
  explodeDistance: 1.1
  fineDetail: 0
