  id: brakes.booster.servo
  nameEnglish: Electromechanical Booster
  nameUzbek: Elektromexanik kuchaytirgich
  descriptionEnglish: Brushless motor and two-stage gear that add force to the driver's
    push rod; it also brakes on its own for the stability and assist systems.
  descriptionUzbek: "Haydovchi shtokiga kuch qo\u2018shuvchi cho\u2018tkasiz motor
